2026-11-20T17:34:35.8132052Z  * OPUS_FLOAT_APPROX, enable floating point approximations (Ensure your platform supports IEEE 754 before enabling).
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8132447Z  * OPUS_ASSERTIONS, additional software error checking.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8132770Z  * OPUS_FUZZING, causes the encoder to make random decisions (do not use in production).
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8133153Z  * OPUS_CHECK_ASM, enable bit-exactness checks between optimized and c implementations.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8133524Z  * OPUS_DNN_FLOAT_DEBUG, Run DNN computations as float for debugging purposes.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8133862Z  * OPUS_INSTALL_CMAKE_CONFIG_MODULE, install CMake package config module.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8134135Z  * OPUS_DRED, enable DRED.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8134309Z  * OPUS_OSCE, enable OSCE.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8134529Z  * OPUS_FIXED_POINT_DEBUG, debug fixed-point implementation.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8134824Z  * OPUS_USE_ALLOCA, use alloca for stack arrays (on non-C99 compilers).
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8135409Z  * OPUS_NONTHREADSAFE_PSEUDOSTACK, use a non threadsafe pseudostack when neither variable length arrays or alloca is supported.
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8135966Z  * OPUS_FAST_MATH, enable fast math (unsupported and discouraged use, as code is not well tested with this build option).
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8136578Z  * OPUS_X86_PRESUME_SSE4_1, assume target CPU has SSE4.1 support (override runtime check).
2026-11-20T17:34:35.8136998Z  * OPUS_X86_PRESUME_AVX2, assume target CPU has AVX FMA AVX2 support (override runtime check).
